{"id":1771980,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-17T15:53:04.297Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1771980,"imdb_id":"tt26424568","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"William Forsythe: From a Classical Position","overview":"William Forsythe, acknowledged as one of the greatest choreographic talents of our time, and his long-time collaborator Dana Caspersen, also of the Frankfurt Ballet, perform a duet conceived especially for the camera. From a Classical Position constitutes a one-off experience of Forsythe and Caspersen's work, giving dance lovers a unique vision of their art as choreographers, dancers and now film-makers. The piece is performed to an original score by Thomas Willems, a composition for a single piano, which like the dance, is at once naked in its simplicity and at times spell-binding in its complex intensity. To this sometimes-music and sometimes-silence performance, Caspersen and Forsythe dance a duet of sublime passion and sophistication, a love story without sentimentality.","popularity":0.0143,"poster_path":"/tfOc8B4y3qcpLwX3JUzAxBzbeFg.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":73999,"logo_path":null,"name":"Euphoria Films","origin_country":"GB"}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"1992-12-31","revenue":0,"runtime":26,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"William Forsythe: From a Classical Position","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"From a Classical Position","type":""}]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6483391,"known_for_department":"Crew","name":"Dana Caspersen","original_name":"Dana Caspersen","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6aab1e6a35eea1b765326105","department":"Crew","job":"Choreographer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1563865,"known_for_department":